:{"b":0,"g":0,"r":0},"content":{"bold":false,"isOutlineEnabled":false,"isShadowEnabled":false,"italic":false,"outlineColor":"255;255;255","outlineThickness":2.0,"shadowAngle":90.0,"shadowBlurRadius":2.0,"shadowColor":"0;0;0","shadowDistance":4.0,"shadowOpacity":127.0,"smoothed":true,"underlined":false,"text":"congrats you beat the demo","font":"Fonts\\AGENCYB.TTF","textAlignment":"center","verticalTextAlignment":"center","characterSize":60.0,"lineHeight":0.0,"color":"0;0;0"}},{"assetStoreId":"","bold":false,"italic":false,"name":"credits_alt","persistentUuid":"a0db44df-d667-4166-b5bf-e80213e7e7d9","smoothed":true,"type":"TextObject::Text","underlined":false,"variables":[],"effects":[],"behaviors":[{"name":"Tween","type":"Tween::TweenBehavior"}],"string":"Congrats you beat the demo.\nRoll those credits!\n\n\nThe Doodler Team [wip name]:\nSmoll Boi\nKirbyKidG\nKedacono/Goobah\nSushi\nMiyameon\nFwoggiz\n\n\nCODING & PROGRAMING:\nSmoll Boi\nKirbyKidG\n\nART:\nSmoll Boi\nKedacono/Goobah\nSushi\n\nMUSIC:\nSmoll Boi\nKedacono/Goobah\n\nLEVEL DESIGNER:\nSmoll Boi\nMiyameon\n\nIDEAS PERSON:\nKirbyKidG\nKedacono/Goobah\nSushi\nMiyameon\n\nPLAYTESTERS & BUG HUNTERS:\nKirbyKidG\nKedacono/Goobah\nSushi\nMiyameon\nFwoggiz\nCarape\n\n\n\n\"Add a credit for specifically dumb idiot and have that one image \nfrom the smoll boi run/old doodlers Mayhem logo\" - KirbyKidG\n[Kirby image here]\n\n\nUntil next time! thanks for playing the demo.+\n\n\n\"This game has always been in my head and I'm so glad I was able to make it come alive. \nThank you to playing the demo! It means a lot to me.\" - Smoll Boi","font":"Fonts\\AGENCYB.TTF","textAlignment":"right","characterSize":60.0,"color":{"b":0,"g":0,"r":0},"content":{"bold":false,"isOutlineEnabled":false,"isShadowEnabled":false,"italic":false,"outlineColor":"255;255;255","outlineThickness":2.0,"shadowAngle":90.0,"shadowBlurRadius":2.0,"shadowColor":"0;0;0","shadowDistance":4.0,"shadowOpacity":127.0,"smoothed":true,"underlined":false,"text":